		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Giant-sized black suit of adamantine alloy, with a half-dozen smokestacks jutting from its back.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 19, <strong>HP</strong> 71, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 slam +10 (3d10), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> -1, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -2, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 15</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Golem</strong>. Immune to damage from cold or non-magical sources. Healed by fire.</p><p></p><p><strong>Indestructible</strong>. Cannot be permanently destroyed unless dispel magic or wish is cast on it while it is at 0 HP.</p><p></p><p><strong>Regenerate</strong>. Regains 3d6 HP per turn, even if reduced to 0 HP.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
